<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">H. Touvron, L. Martin, K. Stone, P. Albert, A. Almahairi, Y. Babaei, N. Bashlykov, S. Batra, P. Bhargava, S. Bhosale, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span>
</span>
