</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S3.SS1.p1.1" title="3.1 Experimental Setup ‣ 3 Experiments ‣ Mitigating Legibility Tax with DecoupledProver-Verifier Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
